      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우연히 길을 지나다가 서로의 라이츄가\n멋지다고 칭찬하고 있었는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C5F0D7880020AE38C7440020C9C0B098B2E4AC000020C11CB85CC7580020B77CC774CE04AC00000ABA4BC9C0B2E4ACE00020CE6DCC2CD558ACE00020C788C5C8B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이야기를 하다 보니 두 라이츄 모두\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨에게서 받은 아이더라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C57CAE30B97C0020D558B2E40020BCF4B2C80020B4500020B77CC774CE040020BAA8B450000A00100002010000000020C528C5D0AC8CC11C0020BC1BC7400020C544C774B354B77CAD6CC6940021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
